    "description": "Raven AKM Grip: FFFTech/FFFTechnology\n\nAn AKM grip with a shallow rounded backstrap and frontal section.\n\nA fairly wide grip, swells from 24.2mm, (Excluding grip top reinforcement) to 30.1mm towards the bottom. From front to back, \nthe longest point is roughly 52mm. \n\nThe top section's reinforcement is based off the AK12 and AK15 grip.\n\n\nComes in two variants: \n\n *Standard\n *Ridged\n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 220C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 4+\nInfill: 25%+\nInfill Pattern: Gyroid\nMaterial Flow: 100%\n\nPrint the grip upside down\n\n\n\nHardware Needed:\n\n1x OEM AK Grip Screw",
